From 64c26878928010e02a64efc66b11ef04f481a911 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 14:42:03 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] logging: structure local networking state and connection
 decisions

Keep local address scores, unsigned inflight byte quantities, signed wait
units and peer-networking state in typed fields. Preserve Info, readable text,
reachability predicates, existing URL token redaction, flow control, discovery,
thread creation and networking RPC behavior. The old onlynet notice replaced
by the canonical listen owner remains deferred for that intake.

The bool is copied directly: tinyformat's %s already sets boolalpha, so true
and false keep their original human rendering. Byte quantities retain their
uint64_t/size_t values despite historical %d format spellings; no narrowing.
An actual one-node fixture turns peer networking off/on through RPC, verifies
both states, and checks the typed JSON and exact readable text after clean stop.
Discovery, pressure-transition and unavailable-transport error branches are
not newly forced by that fixture.

Scripted diff (ast-grep-py 0.51.0):
  /private/tmp/lane-n4-build/logging-compose/ast-venv/bin/python contrib/logging/conversion/convert.py --rules contrib/logging/conversion/rules/network-local-state-diagnostics.json --report /Users/shammah/repos/lotus-v2-repair-work/logging-cleanup/network-state303-conversion.json --apply
  git clang-format --force --binary /opt/homebrew/bin/clang-format --style '{BasedOnStyle: InheritParentConfig, BreakStringLiterals: false}' HEAD -- src/net.cpp

Source-only checkpoint pending combined native gate. Shared eCash owner;
no consensus change. Preserve the immutable native294 proof separately.
